# Build-context ignore for the build/ all-in-one image (context = repo root).
# Mirrors .containerignore so both Docker (BuildKit) and podman slim the context
# the same way — without this the multi-GB .venv dirs blow up the context.
**/.venv
.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.git
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
cuga-skills-ui
docs
